<title>CHINA: Egana gets Esprit jewellery trademark.</title>
<headline>Egana gets Esprit jewellery trademark.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egana International Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday Esprit Holdings Ltd unit Esprit International has granted it a licence to design, manufacture, distribute and promote jewellery under the Esprit trademark.</p>
<p>In return, Egana will pay royalties to Esprit International, with a guaranteed minimum amount payable each year, it said.</p>
<p>The licence holds good until 2000, with an option to renew for another five years, but subject to meeting sales targets.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
